# Pairs with StreamEventuallyComplete. The move switches to its copy but never
# lowers the fence, so every later append is refused and the stream never
# completes; the spec's fairness is intact.
MODULE: StreamEventuallyCompleteSwitchKeepsFence
TARGET: StreamEventuallyComplete
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a completed move leaves the fence raised, so appends stall for ever
PERTURBS: MoveSwitch

--- FIND
    /\ durable' = {o \in moveCopy : o >= tail}
    /\ move' = "idle"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the fence is never lowered.
    /\ durable' = {o \in moveCopy : o >= tail}
    /\ move' = "fenced"
--- END